Go to https://airtable.com/create/tokens
Click "Create new token"
Give it a name (e.g., "Python Script")
Add these scopes:

data.records:read (to read records)
data.records:write (to create/update records)
schema.bases:read (to read base structure)


Under "Access", select the specific base(s) you want to access
Click "Create token"
Copy the token immediately (you won't be able to see it again!)